%YAML 1.1
%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 65acba92923d7b84a8bb6a469a11da9c, type: 3}
  m_Name: DialogueDatabase
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DialogueDatabase
  entries:
  - id: BARK_LOBBY_WAKE_01
    type: 0
    speaker: 0
    textEN: Back on your feet, Sarah?
    textES: "\xBFYa est\xE1s en pie, Sarah?"
    nextId: 
  - id: BARK_LOBBY_WAKE_02
    type: 0
    speaker: 0
    textEN: Curtain falls, curtain rises.
    textES: "Cae el tel\xF3n, sube el tel\xF3n."
    nextId: 
  - id: BARK_LOBBY_WAKE_03
    type: 0
    speaker: 0
    textEN: Rough rehearsal out there?
    textES: "\xBFDuro ensayo ah\xED fuera?"
    nextId: 
  - id: BARK_LOBBY_WAKE_04
    type: 0
    speaker: 0
    textEN: The stage isn't done with you.
    textES: "El escenario a\xFAn no acaba contigo."
    nextId: 
  - id: BARK_LOBBY_WAKE_05
    type: 0
    speaker: 0
    textEN: Still breathing. Good.
    textES: Sigues respirando. Bien.
    nextId: 
  - id: BARK_LOBBY_WAKE_06
    type: 0
    speaker: 0
    textEN: Take a breath before Act Two.
    textES: Respira antes del segundo acto.
    nextId: 
  - id: BARK_LOBBY_WAKE_07
    type: 0
    speaker: 0
    textEN: You missed your cue again.
    textES: Volviste a fallar tu entrada.
    nextId: 
  - id: BARK_LOBBY_WAKE_08
    type: 0
    speaker: 0
    textEN: Another tragic ending, eh?
    textES: "\xBFOtro final tr\xE1gico, eh?"
    nextId: 
  - id: BARK_LOBBY_WAKE_09
    type: 0
    speaker: 0
    textEN: Dust yourself off, kid.
    textES: "Sac\xFAdete el polvo, muchacha."
    nextId: 
  - id: BARK_LOBBY_WAKE_10
    type: 0
    speaker: 0
    textEN: The bedroll missed you.
    textES: El petate te echaba de menos.
    nextId: 
  - id: BARK_KIOSK_GREET_01
    type: 0
    speaker: 0
    textEN: Step right up to the kiosk!
    textES: "\xA1Ac\xE9rcate al quiosco!"
    nextId: 
  - id: BARK_KIOSK_GREET_02
    type: 0
    speaker: 0
    textEN: Fresh props for your next run.
    textES: "Utiler\xEDa nueva para tu funci\xF3n."
    nextId: 
  - id: BARK_KIOSK_GREET_03
    type: 0
    speaker: 0
    textEN: Need an edge backstage?
    textES: "\xBFNecesitas ventaja tras bastidores?"
    nextId: 
  - id: BARK_KIOSK_GREET_04
    type: 0
    speaker: 0
    textEN: Welcome back to the booth.
    textES: Bienvenido de nuevo al puesto.
    nextId: 
  - id: BARK_KIOSK_GREET_05
    type: 0
    speaker: 0
    textEN: Everything's tuned and ready.
    textES: "Todo est\xE1 afinado y listo."
    nextId: 
  - id: BARK_KIOSK_GREET_06
    type: 0
    speaker: 0
    textEN: Browse while the lights hold.
    textES: Mira mientras aguanten las luces.
    nextId: 
  - id: BARK_KIOSK_COMMENT_01
    type: 0
    speaker: 0
    textEN: No refunds after the overture.
    textES: Sin reembolsos tras la obertura.
    nextId: 
  - id: BARK_KIOSK_COMMENT_02
    type: 0
    speaker: 0
    textEN: I polished that one myself.
    textES: "Ese lo pul\xED yo mismo."
    nextId: 
  - id: BARK_KIOSK_COMMENT_03
    type: 0
    speaker: 0
    textEN: Take your time, no rush.
    textES: "T\xF3mate tu tiempo, sin prisa."
    nextId: 
  - id: BARK_KIOSK_COMMENT_04
    type: 0
    speaker: 0
    textEN: Found it under seat twelve.
    textES: "Lo hall\xE9 bajo la butaca doce."
    nextId: 
  - id: BARK_KIOSK_COMMENT_05
    type: 0
    speaker: 0
    textEN: Quality craft, theater grade.
    textES: Buena pieza, calidad de teatro.
    nextId: 
  - id: BARK_KIOSK_COMMENT_06
    type: 0
    speaker: 0
    textEN: The spotlights hum tonight.
    textES: Los focos zumban esta noche.
    nextId: 
  - id: BARK_KIOSK_COMMENT_07
    type: 0
    speaker: 0
    textEN: Buy smart, survive longer.
    textES: "Compra bien, sobrevive m\xE1s."
    nextId: 
  - id: BARK_KIOSK_COMMENT_08
    type: 0
    speaker: 0
    textEN: A fine eye for detail.
    textES: Tienes buen ojo para el detalle.
    nextId: 
  - id: BARK_SHOP_GREET_01
    type: 0
    speaker: 0
    textEN: Quick stop between scenes?
    textES: "\xBFParada r\xE1pida entre escenas?"
    nextId: 
  - id: BARK_SHOP_GREET_02
    type: 0
    speaker: 0
    textEN: Caught me mid-intermission!
    textES: "\xA1Me pillas en el intermedio!"
    nextId: 
  - id: BARK_SHOP_GREET_03
    type: 0
    speaker: 0
    textEN: Supplies before the next act.
    textES: "Provisiones antes del pr\xF3ximo acto."
    nextId: 
  - id: BARK_SHOP_GREET_04
    type: 0
    speaker: 0
    textEN: Grab what you need and run.
    textES: Toma lo que necesites y corre.
    nextId: 
  - id: BARK_SHOP_GREET_05
    type: 0
    speaker: 0
    textEN: Rare goods, tight schedule.
    textES: "Art\xEDculos raros y poco tiempo."
    nextId: 
  - id: BARK_SHOP_GREET_06
    type: 0
    speaker: 0
    textEN: Keep the pace, Sarah!
    textES: "\xA1Mant\xE9n el ritmo, Sarah!"
    nextId: 
  - id: CONV_LOBBY_A_01
    type: 1
    speaker: 0
    textEN: You look pale, Sarah. Did the puppets give you trouble?
    textES: "Est\xE1s p\xE1lida, Sarah. \xBFTe dieron problemas las marionetas?"
    nextId: CONV_LOBBY_A_02
  - id: CONV_LOBBY_A_02
    type: 1
    speaker: 1
    textEN: They move faster once the stage lights dim.
    textES: "Se mueven m\xE1s r\xE1pido en cuanto bajan las luces."
    nextId: CONV_LOBBY_A_03
  - id: CONV_LOBBY_A_03
    type: 1
    speaker: 0
    textEN: Then stay in the spotlight. Talk to me if you need gear.
    textES: "Entonces qu\xE9date bajo el foco. H\xE1blame si necesitas equipo."
    nextId: 
  - id: CONV_LOBBY_B_01
    type: 1
    speaker: 1
    textEN: How long have you been running this lobby?
    textES: "\xBFCu\xE1nto tiempo llevas llevando este vest\xEDbulo?"
    nextId: CONV_LOBBY_B_02
  - id: CONV_LOBBY_B_02
    type: 1
    speaker: 0
    textEN: Since the first play opened. Nobody remembers the script anymore.
    textES: Desde el primer estreno. Ya nadie recuerda el guion.
    nextId: CONV_LOBBY_B_03
  - id: CONV_LOBBY_B_03
    type: 1
    speaker: 1
    textEN: Then I'll just have to improvise my way out.
    textES: "Entonces tendr\xE9 que improvisar mi salida."
    nextId: 
  - id: CONV_LORE_01
    type: 1
    speaker: 0
    textEN: See these velvet curtains? They used to sew them with silver thread.
    textES: "\xBFVes estas cortinas de terciopelo? Antes las cos\xEDan con hilo de
      plata."
    nextId: CONV_LORE_02
  - id: CONV_DEAL_01
    type: 1
    speaker: 0
    textEN: 'A bold bargain: trade half your vitality for double power?'
    textES: "Un trato audaz: \xBFcambias mitad de tu vitalidad por el doble de fuerza?"
    nextId: CHOICE_DEAL_ACCEPT|CHOICE_DEAL_REFUSE
  - id: CHOICE_DEAL_ACCEPT
    type: 2
    speaker: 1
    textEN: Deal. Cut the strings.
    textES: Trato hecho. Corta los hilos.
    nextId: CONV_DEAL_YES_01
  - id: CHOICE_DEAL_REFUSE
    type: 2
    speaker: 1
    textEN: No thanks. I'll keep my blood.
    textES: No, gracias. Prefiero mi sangre.
    nextId: CONV_DEAL_NO_01
